Package: CellDynamicST
Title: Spatial Transcriptomic Analysis of Cell Dynamics, Gene Expression, and Network Interactions
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("First", "Last", email = "author@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0000-0000-0000"))
    )
Description: A comprehensive spatial transcriptomics analysis pipeline for studying
    cell dynamics, gene expression, and network interactions. CellDynamicST implements
    a reference-based generalized clustering algorithm with Random Forest label
    propagation, neurotransmitter and glial cell classification via Gaussian Mixture
    Models, hierarchical cell type annotation, spatial GO enrichment at single-cell
    resolution, inter-regional weighted gene co-expression network analysis (WGCNA),
    hub gene detection via ARACNe/minet, and atlas-projected visualization. The
    package accepts any spatial transcriptomic dataset (CosMx, MERFISH, Visium) as a
    Seurat object and is configured via a single YAML file specifying experimental
    design, comparisons, and analysis parameters.
